'' THE SHIPPED SDL3 EXAMPLES COMPILE: examples/SDL3/renderer/06-textures, which imports vendor/SDL3
'' and loads its picture from Data/, compiles for linux-x86_64, where vendor/SDL3 links the
'' system's SDL3 and so needs no lib/ in the tree.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_PKG=pkg
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.exsdl3/mc
'' ARGS: -target linux-x86_64 -c examples/SDL3/renderer/06-textures/textures.tiko -o build/.exsdl3/textures.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: build/.exsdl3/textures.o
